{"header":"<h1>Module <code><span>Temporal.Time</span></code></h1>","type":"documentation","uses_katex":false,"breadcrumbs":[{"name":"Index","href":"../../../../../index.html","kind":"leaf-page"},{"name":"hegel","href":"../../../../index.html","kind":"page"},{"name":"Hegel","href":"../../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Generators","href":"../../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Temporal","href":"../index.html","kind":"module"},{"name":"Time","href":"#","kind":"module"}],"toc":[],"source_anchor":null,"preamble":"<p>Times of day.</p>","content":"<div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec type anchored\" id=\"type-t\"><a href=\"#type-t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">type</span> t</span><span> = </span><span>{</span></code><ol><li id=\"type-t.hour\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.hour\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>hour : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.minute\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.minute\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>minute : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.second\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.second\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>second : int;</span></code></li><li id=\"type-t.nanosecond\" class=\"def record field anchored\"><a href=\"#type-t.nanosecond\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span>nanosecond : int;</span></code></li></ol><code><span>}</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>A time of day from <code>00:00:00</code> to <code>23:59:59.999999999</code>: <code>hour</code> in <code>[0, 23]</code>, <code>minute</code> and <code>second</code> in <code>[0, 59]</code> (no leap seconds) and <code>nanosecond</code> in <code>[0, 999999999]</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-min_value\"><a href=\"#val-min_value\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> min_value : <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>Midnight, <code>00:00:00</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-max_value\"><a href=\"#val-max_value\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> max_value : <a href=\"#type-t\">t</a></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p>The last nanosecond of the day, <code>23:59:59.999999999</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-to_string\"><a href=\"#val-to_string\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> to_string : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> string</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>to_string time</code> formats <code>time</code>: <code>02:30:00</code>, or <code>02:30:00.5</code> when the fractional part is nonzero.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-pp\"><a href=\"#val-pp\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> pp : <span><span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Stdlib</span>.Format.formatter <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> unit</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>pp formatter time</code> prints <code>to_string time</code>.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-sexp_of_t\"><a href=\"#val-sexp_of_t\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> sexp_of_t : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span class=\"xref-unresolved\">Sexplib0</span>.Sexp.t</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>sexp_of_t time</code> is <code>to_string time</code> as an atom.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-equal\"><a href=\"#val-equal\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> equal : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> bool</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>equal a b</code> returns whether <code>a</code> and <code>b</code> have the same fields.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-compare\"><a href=\"#val-compare\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> compare : <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> <span><a href=\"#type-t\">t</a> <span class=\"arrow\">&#45;&gt;</span></span> int</span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>compare a b</code> orders valid times from midnight on.</p></div></div><div class=\"odoc-spec\"><div class=\"spec value anchored\" id=\"val-hegel_generator\"><a href=\"#val-hegel_generator\" class=\"anchor\"></a><code><span><span class=\"keyword\">val</span> hegel_generator : <span><span>(<a href=\"#type-t\">t</a>, <a href=\"../../index.html#type-printable\">printable</a>)</span> <a href=\"../../index.html#type-generator\">generator</a></span></span></code></div><div class=\"spec-doc\"><p><code>times ()</code>, every time of day.</p></div></div>"}